## Visual Studio / .NET / WPF / Windows — .gitignore optimizado

# ── Build results ─────────────────────────────────────────────
[Dd]ebug/
[Dd]ebugPublic/
[Rr]elease/
[Rr]eleases/
x64/
x86/
[Aa]rm/
[Aa]rm64/
bld/
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Ll]og/
[Ll]ogs/
[Pp]ublish/

# ── Visual Studio user and workspace settings ──────────────────
.vs/
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.slnx.user

# ── Visual Studio Code settings ───────────────────────────────
.vscode/
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/extensions.json

# ── NuGet (SDK-style projects usan restore automático) ────────
*.nupkg
*.snupkg

# ── JetBrains Rider / ReSharper ───────────────────────────────
.idea/
*.sln.iml
_ReSharper*/

# ── WPF / Windows resource files ─────────────────────────────
*.aps

# ── Windows / OS generated files ──────────────────────────────
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# ── User-specific files ────────────────────────────────────────
*.rsuser
*.suo
*.userlibraries

# ── Log and temp files ────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
*.tmp